An update to LittlePuny's amazing Endless Legend mod :) The mod won't display in the in-game download menu, so here's the direct link https://github.com/MangaPwnz/Endless-Legend-Civilizations-Updated.
Major changes:
- Bugfixes
- Major overhaul of Cult of the Eternal End and Mykara to bring them closer to their EL versions.

### Cult of the Eternal End's
- Agressive One City Civ with founds Converted Villages (puppet cities) on barbarian camps and city ruins instead of normal cities. Converted Villages have almost no yields, but provides free Converts which can be used to build melee units.
- Razes cities faster in order to get Resource Stockpiles, which can be used to greatly boost Food, Production or Science in your capital for 1 turn per stockpile.


### Mykara
- One City Civ. Replaces Settler with Spore Bearer, which can build Fungal Blooms outside your borders
- Fungal Blooms grants resources and yields to your capital depending on the tile it's on, scaling with technologies and some buildings. Eventually creating a super capital
- Uses their Mycelial Network to move around the map in favor of traditional roads




